{"speciesId":136,"names":{"fr":"Pyroli","es":"Flareon","en":"Flareon","ja":"ブースター"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"When storing thermal energy in its body, its temperature could soar to over 1600 degrees."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"When storing thermal energy in its body, its temperature could soar to over 1600 degrees."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"It has a flame chamber inside its body. It inhales, then blows out fire that is over 3,000F degrees."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It stores some of the air it inhales in its internal flame pouch, which heats it to over 3,000 degrees."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It fluffs out its fur collar to cool down its body temperature, which can reach 1,650 degrees."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Once it has stored up enough heat, this POKéMON's body temperature can reach up to 1700 degrees."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"FLAREON’s fluffy fur has a functional purpose - it releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. This POKéMON’s body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"FLAREON’s fluffy fur has a functional purpose - it releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. This POKéMON’s body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"FLAREON’s fluffy fur releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. Its body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has a flame bag inside its body. After inhaling deeply, it blows out flames of nearly 3,100 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When storing thermal energy in its body, its temperature can soar to over 1,600 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a flame sac in its body. Its body temperature tops 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit before battle."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has a flame sac in its body. Its body temperature tops 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit before battle."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Inhaled air is heated in the flame sac in its body to an intense fire over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It stores some of the air it inhales in its internal flame pouch, which heats it to over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It fluffs out its fur collar to cool down its body temperature, which can reach 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"L’air qu’il inspire est chauffé par la glande enflammée de son corps, atteignant les 1 700 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Inhaled air is heated in the flame sac in its body to an intense fire over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"L’air qu’il inspire est chauffé par la glande enflammée de son corps, atteignant les 1 700 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Inhaled air is heated in the flame sac in its body to an intense fire over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Inhaled air is carried to its flame sac, heated, and exhaled as fire that reaches over 3,000 degrees F."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Inhaled air is carried to its flame sac, heated, and exhaled as fire that reaches over 3,000 degrees F."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps contient une glande enflammée. Sa température monte à 900 °C avant le combat."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Almacena llamas en su cuerpo, que alcanza una temperatura de 900 °C antes de un combate."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has a flame sac in its body. Its body temperature tops 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit before battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体内に 炎袋を 持つ。 戦いが はじまる 直前には 体温が ９００度まで 上がる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pyroli a une poche de feu à l’intérieur de son corps. Après une bonne inspiration, il est capable de recracher des flammes à 1 700 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Almacena llamas en el interior de su cuerpo. Tras inhalar profundamente, las lanza a una temperatura de 1700 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has a flame bag inside its body. After inhaling deeply, it blows out flames of nearly 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体内に 炎袋があり 深く 息を 吸いこんだあと １７００度の 火を 吐く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La fourrure soyeuse de Pyroli a une fonction anatomique. Elle rejette la chaleur dans l’air pour que son corps ne surchauffe pas. La température du corps de ce Pokémon peut atteindre 900 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La suavidad del pelaje de Flareon tiene una función clara: libera calor para que el Pokémon no se asfixie. La temperatura corporal de este Pokémon puede alcanzar los 900 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Flareon’s fluffy fur has a functional purpose—it releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. This Pokémon’s body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ふさふさの 体毛は 上がり過ぎた 体温を 空気に 放熱して 下げる 機能を 持つ。 体温は 最高 ９００度 まで 上がるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La fourrure soyeuse de Pyroli a une fonction anatomique. Elle rejette la chaleur dans l’air pour que son corps ne surchauffe pas. La température du corps de ce Pokémon peut atteindre 900 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La suavidad del pelaje de Flareon tiene una función clara: libera calor para que el Pokémon no se asfixie. La temperatura corporal de este Pokémon puede alcanzar los 900 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Flareon’s fluffy fur has a functional purpose—it releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. This Pokémon’s body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ふさふさの 体毛は 上がり過ぎた 体温を 空気に 放熱して 下げる 機能を 持つ。 体温は 最高 ９００度 まで 上がるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Après avoir trouvé une proie et quelques Baies, il crache du feu jusqu’à ce qu’elles soient cuites à point avant de les gober."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Antes de hincarle el diente a algo, ya sean bayas o alguna presa, lo cocina con sus llamas hasta que queda bien hecho."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When it catches prey or finds berries, it breathes fire on them until they’re well done, and then it gobbles them up."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"木の実や 獲物を 捕まえると 炎を 吹いて ウェルダンぐらいに なるまで 焼きあげてから ガブリ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Sa température moyenne est entre 700 et 800 °C. La poche de feu à l’intérieur de son corps peut atteindre 1 700 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"La temperatura corporal de este Pokémon ronda los 700 u 800 °C. Las llamas que almacena en su bolsa interior pueden llegar a los 1700 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its average body temperature is between 1,300 and 1,500 degrees Fahrenheit. In its internal flame sac, temperatures reach 3,000 degrees."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"平均体温 ７～８００度。 体内に ある 炎袋では １７００度の 炎が 燃えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Si vous le voyez inspirer profondément, sauvez-vous, car c’est le signe qu’il va attaquer en soufflant une flamme à 1 700 °C !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cuando inspira profundamente es señal de que se dispone a atacar. Expele llamaradas que alcanzan temperaturas de 1700 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"If it inhales deeply, that’s a sign it’s about to attack. Prepare to be hit by flames of over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"大きく 空気を 吸い込むのは 攻撃の サイン。 １７００度の 炎が 襲ってくるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lorsqu’il est agité, sa poche de feu interne s’enflamme, et sa température corporelle peut alors monter jusqu’à 900 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cuando su ánimo se altera, las llamas que almacena en su bolsa interior se avivan y su temperatura corporal llega a los 900 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The flame chamber inside its body ignites when Flareon gets agitated, reaching temperatures of up to 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"興奮すると 体内に ある 炎袋に 火が ついて 体温は ９００度 まで あがる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"La poche de feu à l’intérieur de son corps transforme l’air qu’il inspire en flammes à 1 700 ºC qu’il recrache par la bouche."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"La bolsa en el interior de su cuerpo le permite convertir el aire que aspira en llamas a 1700 °C que luego exhala por la boca."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"It has a flame chamber inside its body. It inhales, then breathes out fire that is over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"体内に 炎袋が あって 吸い込んだ 息を １７００度の 炎にして 口から 吐き出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"La poche de feu à l’intérieur de son corps transforme l’air qu’il inspire en flammes à 1 700 ºC qu’il recrache par la bouche."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"La bolsa en el interior de su cuerpo le permite convertir el aire que aspira en llamas a 1700 °C que luego exhala por la boca."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"It has a flame chamber inside its body. It inhales, then breathes out fire that is over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"体内に 炎袋が あって 吸い込んだ 息を １７００度の 炎にして 口から 吐き出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Après avoir emmagasiné suffisamment de chaleur, sa température corporelle peut monter jusqu’à 900 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Una vez que ha almacenado el calor suficiente, puede alcanzar una temperatura de 900 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Once it has stored up enough heat, this Pokémon’s body temperature can reach up to 1,700 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体内に 炎が 溜まると ブースターの 体温も 最高 ９００度 まで 上がっていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il emmagasine de l’air dans sa poche de flammes et le chauffe à une température de 1 700 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Almacena parte del aire que inhala en la saca de fuego de su interior, que llega a calentarse a más de 1700 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It stores some of the air it inhales in its internal flame pouch, which heats it to over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"吸いこんだ 空気の 一部は 体内の 炎袋に 送られ １７００度の 炎に なる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Flames burn within a saclike organ inside this Pokémon. When Flareon inhales, these flames grow in intensity, reaching a mighty 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit."}],"varieties":[{"id":136,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[19,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",8],[3,"level-up",8],[4,"level-up",8],[5,"level-up",8],[6,"level-up",8],[7,"level-up",8],[8,"level-up",8],[9,"level-up",8],[10,"level-up",8],[11,"level-up",8],[12,"level-up",8],[13,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5],[19,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",14],[20,"level-up",5],[23,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","lea